{"v":4,"catch":"在新的隱藏物品遊戲中尋找怪癖 - 怪怪的！","desc":"黑白塗鴉藝術風格的圖像構成了一款具有挑戰性的遊戲。\n\n水母穿鞋嗎？\n\n在地圖上查找實際上沒有連接的角色和對象。 趕快！ 時鐘在滴答作響。\n\n進入森林越遠\n\n收集所需積分後將解鎖更多級別。 它會變得越來越難，因為時間在流逝，你要找到越來越多的傻角色。\n\n\n主要特徵：\n\n- 手繪塗鴉藝術風格圖形\n- 13 張地圖可供選擇\n- 各種難度級別\n- 時髦風格的配樂","publisher":"REDDEER.GAMES","release":"2023-02-02","genres":["益智","訓練","其他"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["英文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.2GB / Switch 0.2GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/729a9136b30745d8496978c6a14cd4401eaa07057a2e8ac3014a80fad636ff16.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/801bfbb3672a8d0fc39719db929e5c12a0a7652c3e5cd2e47605274c51b8f673.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/3f9fff9ddee0e245c69396a6a34c941176c1338222c6adb613b740c550960282.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/faa54bb59397623860465e0add7ac1b20b7bdbad17f07d5cc1e3fa85c6b94efe.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/869ce5e07786dbf3ff20b4e18dd91540887ce27e15f961d6bcd41cf8db236f89.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/a76fcdde8990f482152a1130627cb8607c7f9c2bdd0aa724962e0dc7df5ccff2.jpg"],"titleId":"01005100195b2000","dlc":[]}